1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,487
Meet RecceFlow, a simpler way to manage signage site surveys.

2
00:00:03,487 --> 00:00:09,204
Bring the site visit, material measurements, marked photos and office review into one clear journey.

3
00:00:09,204 --> 00:00:11,548
Here is the interactive client prototype.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,550
Start by creating a recce job, or import the supplied Excel or CSV template.

5
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:19,363
Add the shop, client, address and recce person.

6
00:00:19,363 --> 00:00:23,254
Colour labels make pending work and new submissions easy to find.

7
00:00:23,733 --> 00:00:26,602
The recce person opens the job and starts the visit.

8
00:00:26,602 --> 00:00:30,960
Capture the device location when permission is available, or enter the address.

9
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:35,042
Type observations or record a voice note about access, mounting and power.

10
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:40,666
Add a separate card for each physical material, even when two boards use the same material.

11
00:00:40,666 --> 00:00:42,937
Enter width and height, length or count.

12
00:00:42,937 --> 00:00:45,037
Choose a placement or write your own.

13
00:00:45,037 --> 00:00:48,330
Rectangular area follows the measurements entered on site.

14
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:54,393
Capture or upload a site photo, then mark the relevant material using shapes, colours or freehand drawing.

15
00:00:54,393 --> 00:00:57,401
The item code and entered dimensions appear on the image.

16
00:00:57,401 --> 00:01:02,256
Save multiple independent views and download a marked image or the job's complete image ZIP.

17
00:01:02,733 --> 00:01:06,137
Review the site details and material evidence before submitting.

18
00:01:06,137 --> 00:01:09,062
The office can verify the recce or request corrections.

19
00:01:09,062 --> 00:01:15,285
If the assigned person becomes unavailable, reassign editable work while keeping its saved photos and notes together.

20
00:01:15,767 --> 00:01:19,047
Build a material report for one job or a filtered set.

21
00:01:19,047 --> 00:01:22,752
Choose the columns, set their order and add a client heading.

22
00:01:22,752 --> 00:01:27,368
Export Excel or CSV, or use Print and Save as PDF to include visible photos.

23
00:01:27,833 --> 00:01:30,354
Raise an issue by typing or recording a note.

24
00:01:30,354 --> 00:01:35,507
Demonstrate office and developer replies, and track Pending, Processing and Resolved status.

25
00:01:35,507 --> 00:01:41,219
This portable prototype saves data only in your browser; support messages here are a local simulation.

26
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:46,038
Open the interactive demo and try the complete journey with sample records.

27
00:01:46,038 --> 00:01:49,335
RecceFlow: clearer site evidence, smoother office review.

28
00:01:49,335 --> 00:01:51,765
Request a personalised demo for your team.
